[I] ANSI color formatting for output in terminal

[T] termcolor is a small Python library for ANSI color formatting of
[T] terminal output. Its colored() function adds text colors, background
[T] highlights and attributes such as bold or underline, and respects the
[T] NO_COLOR and FORCE_COLOR environment variables.

[U] https://pypi.org/project/termcolor/

